# Play test of Wreckers' Cove (CIPlay wreckers_cove, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the jetty
# (2.75 m) up to the hamlet's terrace (2.4 m), the Marigold on the reef at the cove's mouth (her deck awash), the den's
# floor at the sea (0.1-0.9 m), the boardwalk along the east arm (0.4 m), the false lantern's roof (11.2 m).
island Wreckers' Cove
expect step 0
expect title The False Lantern

# Up the jetty onto the hamlet's terrace
walk -12 -20 to -12 -2 to -11 1 h=2.4
zone cove
expect step 1
read Hamlet notice
expect step 2

# Out to the Marigold on the reef: her log, the captain's chest and the den key
at -7.5 -50
zone aboard
expect message stripped to the ribs
expect step 3
read Marigold's log
expect step 4
open Captain's chest
expect story denkey 1
expect step 6

# Along the shore to the smugglers' den in the hills' north-east corner: the rats, the strongbox and the lantern key
walk -6 -4.5 to 2 -6 to 8 -5 to 15 2 h=0.5
zone den
expect step 7
expect message something squeaking
kill Rat
expect step 8
expect animals Rat 0
walk 15 2 to 23 10 h=0.7
open Smugglers' strongbox
expect story lanternkey 1
expect step 9

# Out of the den, along the boardwalk to the south point: the keeper's log in his room; up the false lantern's ladder
# onto its roof
walk 23 10 to 15 2 to 8 -5 to 10.9 -7.4 to 16.2 -19 to 16.6 -32 to 25 -42.6 to 30 -44.5 to 36 -47.3 h=4.5
read Keeper's log
expect step 10
at 36 -47.3 h=4.5
climb 41 -52.6 h=5.4
expect stand 41 -48 h=11.18
at 41 -47 h=11.35
zone lantern
expect step 11

# The lantern doused: the hoard's chain falls slack
use douse
expect message lantern gutters
expect hidden lantern
open Wreckers' hoard
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight 1
expect done
